	(text "We should remember that we cannot use:\n- 34, 35, 36, 39: Are only input pins without an internal resistor (Good for interrupts though)\n- 6, 7, 8, 9, 10, 11: Flash memory, do not use\n- 0, 2: Strapping pin (booting the esp32)\n- 1, 3: Serial line for debugging\n- 4, 12, 13, 14, 25, 26, 27: Only digital reads and writes work with wifi"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 302.006 126.746 0)
		(effects
